WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.000
ALEXEI SHOSTAKOV
Natasha, you're not just a spy.

00:00:03.594 --> 00:00:05.703
You're an Avenger.

00:00:06.727 --> 00:00:08.860
I couldn't be more proud of you.

00:00:09.336 --> 00:00:10.711
YELENA BELOVA
You smell really bad.

00:00:12.724 --> 00:00:14.310
YELENA BELOVA
What brings you home?

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:15.974
NATASHA ROMANOFF
We have unfinished business.

00:00:16.404 --> 00:00:17.592
(The experience...)

00:00:17.592 --> 00:00:18.803
ALEXEI SHOSTAKOV
Still fits.

00:00:18.803 --> 00:00:20.037
MELINA VOSTOKOFF
[Whistles]

00:00:20.037 --> 00:00:21.904
(...will be worth the wait.)

00:00:23.451 --> 00:00:24.399
NATASHA ROMANOFF
Let's go.

